# Large source media never gets committed; only the web-optimized derivatives
# in img/ are. The current files in source-photos/ are small Facebook-sized
# JPEGs and are tracked deliberately (they are the only copies of the brand
# fliers and originals we have). If Emmi hands over camera originals
# (HEIC/RAW/multi-GB folders), they land in source-photos/ and these rules
# keep them out of git.
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.heif
*.HEIF
*.MOV
*.mov
*.dng
*.DNG
*.psd
*.PSD
*.cr2
*.CR2
*.arw
*.ARW

# Secrets, if this repo ever gains a backend
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
local.settings.json
